                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR ANLAGENINDEXIERUNG IN EINER HYDROPONISCHEN LANDWIRTSCHAFTSUMGEBUNG UND HYDROPONISCHE LANDWIRTSCHAFTSUMGEBUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ D'INDEXATION DE PLANTES DANS UN ENVIRONNEMENT D'AGRICULTURE HYDROPONIQUE ET ENVIRONNEMENT D'AGRICULTURE HYDROPONIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR PLANT INDEXING IN A HYDROPONIC FARMING ENVIRONMENT AND A HYDROPONIC FARMING ENVIRONMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A farming method may be shown and described. In an exemplary embodiment, plants may begin in a germination phase. Next, plants are brought to a nursery for a period of time before optionally being transplanted to one or more subsequent nurseries. Finally, plants are transplanted to a greenhouse where they may grow until they are ready for harvest. In an exemplary embodiment, the nursery phases may be vertical farms while the greenhouse phase may be a traditional farm which receives sunlight. Al may be implemented to optimize environmental conditions and robotics may be used to harvest the plants. Plants may be indexed in order to efficiently expedite plant growth and optimize the time in each phase.</p>
            </abstract>
